        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "## Correlation Matrix\n",
        "\n",
        "### From Visual Association to Numerical Association\n",
        "  \n",
        "A scatterplot gives us a **visual impression** of a relationship.\n",
        "  \n",
        "Correlation gives us a numerical measure of **linear association**.\n",
        "  \n",
        "The correlation coefficient ranges from:\n",
        "  \n",
        "$$\n",
        "-1 \\leq r \\leq 1\n",
        "$$\n",
        "  \n",
        "where:\n",
        "  \n",
        "- $r \\approx +1$ → strong positive linear association\n",
        "- $r \\approx 0$ → little linear association\n",
        "- $r \\approx -1$ → strong negative linear association    \n",
        "  \n",
        "::: {.callout-tip title=\"💻Coding Session\"}"
      ],
      "id": "29e6c071"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
