        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "  \n",
        "# Introduction to Forecasting with Time Series\n",
        "  \n",
        "**🔄 Now Let's Change the Question**\n",
        "\n",
        "So far, we have asked:\n",
        "  \n",
        "> **What factors are associated with cement sales?**\n",
        "  \n",
        "We used:\n",
        "  \n",
        "**Advertising + Housing + Price + Rainfall + GDP Growth**\n",
        "  \n",
        "to understand cement sales.  \n",
        "  \n",
        "But what if we ask:\n",
        "  \n",
        "> **What does the history of cement sales itself tell us about future sales?**\n",
        "  \n",
        "## MLR vs TS\n",
        "  \n",
        "| MLR | Time Series |\n",
        "|---|---|\n",
        "| Looks across variables | Looks along time |\n",
        "| Uses explanatory variables | Uses the history of the series |\n",
        "| What helps explain/predict sales? | What does past sales tell us about future sales? |\n",
        "\n",
        "## Visualizing Time Series Data\n",
        "\n",
        "We are no longer primarily asking:\n",
        "\n",
        "> **\"What explains sales?\"**\n",
        "\n",
        "We are asking:\n",
        "\n",
        "> **\"How does sales behaviour evolve through time?\"**\n",
        "\n",
        ":::{.callout-tip title=\"💻Coding Session\"}"
      ],
      "id": "1794202c"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
