        "- **Trend** — Is sales generally increasing or decreasing?\n",
        "- **Seasonality** — Does a pattern repeat at regular intervals?\n",
        "- **Cycles** — Are there longer-term rises and falls?\n",
        "- **Unusual observations** — Are there unexpected spikes or drops?"
